    "result": "`invoice_totals` is implemented in `solution.py`, and the 17 tests in `tests/test_solution.py` pass with `python -m pytest -q tests`.\n\nIt validates inputs and raises `ValueError` for the cases in the spec. The line net applies the line discount and then the extra 5% bulk discount for `standard` lines with qty of 10 or more. Rounding is half-up per line. Credit, `total_due` and `credit_left` follow the spec, and `tax_by_rate` includes 0-rate entries only for rates that appear on a line.\n\nThe tests cover:\n- Empty invoices and the 0-rate entry.\n- Stacked discounts and the bulk rule.\n- Per-line rounding and region B.\n- Partial and full credit.\n- The error cases and the 0 and 100 discount bounds.",
